{"timestamp": "2026-03-28T15:05:08.311188Z", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "aiosqlite", "message": "executing functools.partial(<built-in method execute of sqlite3.Cursor object at 0x0000022CDA0F4340>, 'INSERT INTO outbox_events (id, event_type, aggregate_type, aggregate_id, state, payload_json, dedupe_key, attempt, generation, lease_owner, heartbeat_at, last_error, next_retry_at, available_at, created_at, updated_at, completed_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)', ('3863519c-a946-4b9a-be94-90b4b3908445', 'session_transcript_persist', 'session_transcript', 'd1a3a82a-ea6c-4438-9fc3-e3c6bfc5c854:f4af07b3-40f2-4af2-9dbd-d53ee62861fe', 'pending', '{\"bot\": {\"id\": \"d1a3a82a-ea6c-4438-9fc3-e3c6bfc5c854\", \"name\": \"Hubbase Chatbot\", \"provider_type\": \"local\", \"model\": \"qwen2.5:1.5b\"}, \"session_id\": \"f4af07b3-40f2-4af2-9dbd-d53ee62861fe\", \"user_message\": \"tell me about hubbse services.\", \"assistant_response\": \"Certainly! Hubbase is a comprehensive platform designed to help businesses of all sizes streamline their operations, improve customer engagement, and enhance overall performance. Here\\\\u2019s a breakdown of the main services offered by Hubbase:\\\\n\\\\n1. **Customer Relationship Management (CRM) Tools**: Hubbase includes CRM features that allow businesses to manage their interactions with customers in a single, centralized platform. This includes tools for tracking customer interactions, managing leads, following up on sales, and managing customer service.\\\\n\\\\n2. **Sales Automation**: The platform offers tools to help businesses automate sales processes, including appointment scheduling, email marketing, and lead management.\\\\n\\\\n3. **Service Management**: For businesses that provide services, Hubbase offers tools to manage customer service interactions, track service requests, and maintain customer service records.\\\\n\\\\n4. **Project Management**: Hubbase integrates project management tools that help businesses manage and track projects from start to finish, including tasks, assignments, and deadlines.\\\\n\\\\n5. **Inventory Management**: Businesses can use Hubbase to manage their inventory, including tracking stock levels, generating purchase orders, and managing supplier relationships.\\\\n\\\\n6. **Marketing Automation**: The platform includes marketing automation tools that help businesses automate the planning, execution, and measurement of marketing campaigns.\\\\n\\\\n7. **Analytics and Reporting**: Hubbase provides analytics tools that help businesses analyze their operations, customer interactions, and sales performance. This includes dashboards, reports, and custom reports tailored to specific business needs.\\\\n\\\\n8. **Integration with Other Tools**: Hubbase integrates with various third-party tools and systems, allowing businesses to streamline their operations even further by combining different services into a cohesive platform.\\\\n\\\\n9. **Training and Support**: Hubbase offers training and support resources to help businesses get the most out of their platform, including webinars, tutorials, and a community forum.\\\\n\\\\n10. **Customization and Scalability**: Hubbase is designed to be highly customizable, allowing businesses to tailor the platform to their specific needs. It also offers scalability, making it suitable for businesses of all sizes.\\\\n\\\\nIf you have a specific question or issue related to one of these services, feel free to ask, and I can provide more detailed information.\", \"tokens_used\": 675, \"latency_ms\": 5088, \"retries_used\": 0, \"fallback_used\": true, \"rag_used\": false}', 'session_transcript_persist:d1a3a82a-ea6c-4438-9fc3-e3c6bfc5c854:f4af07b3-40f2-4af2-9dbd-d53ee62861fe:d2f8a31eb4b6', 0, 1, None, None, None, None, '2026-03-28 15:05:08.310358', '2026-03-28 15:05:08.310365', '2026-03-28 15:05:08.310369', None))"}
{"timestamp": "2026-03-28T15:05:08.312090Z", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "aiosqlite", "message": "operation functools.partial(<built-in method execute of sqlite3.Cursor object at 0x0000022CDA0F4340>, 'INSERT INTO outbox_events (id, event_type, aggregate_type, aggregate_id, state, payload_json, dedupe_key, attempt, generation, lease_owner, heartbeat_at, last_error, next_retry_at, available_at, created_at, updated_at, completed_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)', ('3863519c-a946-4b9a-be94-90b4b3908445', 'session_transcript_persist', 'session_transcript', 'd1a3a82a-ea6c-4438-9fc3-e3c6bfc5c854:f4af07b3-40f2-4af2-9dbd-d53ee62861fe', 'pending', '{\"bot\": {\"id\": \"d1a3a82a-ea6c-4438-9fc3-e3c6bfc5c854\", \"name\": \"Hubbase Chatbot\", \"provider_type\": \"local\", \"model\": \"qwen2.5:1.5b\"}, \"session_id\": \"f4af07b3-40f2-4af2-9dbd-d53ee62861fe\", \"user_message\": \"tell me about hubbse services.\", \"assistant_response\": \"Certainly! Hubbase is a comprehensive platform designed to help businesses of all sizes streamline their operations, improve customer engagement, and enhance overall performance. Here\\\\u2019s a breakdown of the main services offered by Hubbase:\\\\n\\\\n1. **Customer Relationship Management (CRM) Tools**: Hubbase includes CRM features that allow businesses to manage their interactions with customers in a single, centralized platform. This includes tools for tracking customer interactions, managing leads, following up on sales, and managing customer service.\\\\n\\\\n2. **Sales Automation**: The platform offers tools to help businesses automate sales processes, including appointment scheduling, email marketing, and lead management.\\\\n\\\\n3. **Service Management**: For businesses that provide services, Hubbase offers tools to manage customer service interactions, track service requests, and maintain customer service records.\\\\n\\\\n4. **Project Management**: Hubbase integrates project management tools that help businesses manage and track projects from start to finish, including tasks, assignments, and deadlines.\\\\n\\\\n5. **Inventory Management**: Businesses can use Hubbase to manage their inventory, including tracking stock levels, generating purchase orders, and managing supplier relationships.\\\\n\\\\n6. **Marketing Automation**: The platform includes marketing automation tools that help businesses automate the planning, execution, and measurement of marketing campaigns.\\\\n\\\\n7. **Analytics and Reporting**: Hubbase provides analytics tools that help businesses analyze their operations, customer interactions, and sales performance. This includes dashboards, reports, and custom reports tailored to specific business needs.\\\\n\\\\n8. **Integration with Other Tools**: Hubbase integrates with various third-party tools and systems, allowing businesses to streamline their operations even further by combining different services into a cohesive platform.\\\\n\\\\n9. **Training and Support**: Hubbase offers training and support resources to help businesses get the most out of their platform, including webinars, tutorials, and a community forum.\\\\n\\\\n10. **Customization and Scalability**: Hubbase is designed to be highly customizable, allowing businesses to tailor the platform to their specific needs. It also offers scalability, making it suitable for businesses of all sizes.\\\\n\\\\nIf you have a specific question or issue related to one of these services, feel free to ask, and I can provide more detailed information.\", \"tokens_used\": 675, \"latency_ms\": 5088, \"retries_used\": 0, \"fallback_used\": true, \"rag_used\": false}', 'session_transcript_persist:d1a3a82a-ea6c-4438-9fc3-e3c6bfc5c854:f4af07b3-40f2-4af2-9dbd-d53ee62861fe:d2f8a31eb4b6', 0, 1, None, None, None, None, '2026-03-28 15:05:08.310358', '2026-03-28 15:05:08.310365', '2026-03-28 15:05:08.310369', None)) completed"}
