lyze their operations, customer interactions, and sales performance. This includes dashboards, reports, and custom reports tailored to specific business needs.\\\\n\\\\n8. **Integration with Other Tools**: Hubbase integrates with various third-party tools and systems, allowing businesses to streamline their operations even further by combining different services into a cohesive platform.\\\\n\\\\n9. **Training and Support**: Hubbase offers training and support resources to help businesses get the most out of their platform, including webinars, tutorials, and a community forum.\\\\n\\\\n10. **Customization and Scalability**: Hubbase is designed to be highly customizable, allowing businesses to tailor the platform to their specific needs. It also offers scalability, making it suitable for businesses of all sizes.\\\\n\\\\nIf you have a specific question or issue related to one of these services, feel free to ask, and I can provide more detailed information.\", \"session_id\": \"f4af07b3-40f2-4af2-9dbd-d53ee62861fe\", \"tokens_used\": 675, \"latency_ms\": 5088, \"retry_count\": 0, \"fallback_used\": true, \"status_message\": \"completed_with_fallback\", \"degraded_components\": [\"rag\"], \"data_freshness\": \"stale\", \"safe_modes\": [\"RAG_BYPASS_EXPLICIT\"], \"context_scope\": null, \"context_sources\": [], \"citations\": []}', '[\"rag\"]', None, '2026-03-28 15:05:08.323844', '2026-03-28 15:05:08.323844', '2026-03-28 15:05:08.323844', '4a27785f-9afc-4563-9626-64131601faca'))"}
