u know the answer. If a detail is unavailable, say exactly: \\'I don\\'t have the specific details on that right now. I recommend checking our General Contact Page to speak with a specialist.\\' When sharing links, format them as markdown like [Link Text](URL).\", \"query\": \"how are you\", \"query_embedding\": [-0.03136894106864929, 0.03783048689365387, 0.07630810886621475, 0.04569954425096512, -0.0012047371128574014, -0.07476909458637238, 0.08157846331596375, 0.010209406726062298, -0.11220549792051315, 0.040734343230724335, -0.04470580443739891, -0.00902863871306181, -0.022976264357566833, -0.009182563051581383, 0.007133564446121454, -0.03529728576540947, 0.07896504551172256, -0.0991559848189354, -0.12103836238384247, 0.03257376328110695, -0.09918766468763351, 0.03196953237056732, 0.001739421975798905, 0.08815881609916687, -0.026670120656490326, 0.017091618850827217, -0.04135071486234665, -0.03918186202645302, 0.03500918298959732, -0.07608207315206528, -0.06472419202327728, 0.022676223888993263, -0.049569062888622284, -0.027594126760959625, -0.05726960673928261, -0.04053007811307907, 0.01654030568897724, -0.10059664398431778, -0.0487324520945549, -0.022784555330872536, 0.0208550076931715, -0.06302400678396225, -0.019444197416305542, -0.02730954997241497, 0.07852309197187424, -0.04114217683672905, 0.015361388213932514, 0.03348730877041817, 0.09579644352197647, 0.05921603739261627, -0.09707312285900116, -0.023396186530590057, -0.05955906957387924, 0.029372625052928925, 0.021432673558592796, 0.04165324568748474, -0.03334600850939751, 0.042553313076496124, 0.03954600915312767, -0.01155806239694357, 0.06694881618022919, 0.02157546952366829, -0.06559105962514877, 0.01254552137106657, 0.08388127386569977, -0.025172749534249306, -0.05293731018900871, -0.023182766512036324, -0.030786855146288872, -0.035774633288383484, -0.04332016408443451, -0.06390700489282608, 0.04137134552001953, 0.04953290522098541, 0.02459125593304634, -0.06853333115577698, 0.04845777526497841, -0.02